      48.02,
      491.75,
      286.84,
      598.05
    ],
    "text": "LAND/5/65. Land Ministry\u2019s Reference No.: 4-3/24/2022/HA/09. I hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of Section 7, of Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act No. 28 of 1964 that the Government intends to acquire the following land/servitude which is required for construction of the Grama Niladhari Office of the Grama Niladhari Division of Pamunuwa.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.02,
      597.61,
      286.75,
      703.79
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/servitude to be acquired : An allotment in extent of 0.0153 Hectare of the land called Wediyakpitiya Hena, Hapugahamula Pitiya Vedakara Gedara Pahala Watta depicted as Lot No. 01 in the Cadastral Map bearing No. 310420 situated at Pamunuwa Village in Pamunuwa Grama Niladhari Division which bearing No. E339 of Asgiri Udasiya Pattuwa Minor Division in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Yatawatta in Matale District of Central Province.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
