    "text": "Niladhari Office of the Grama Niladhari Division of Pamunuwa; Claimants : 1. Konara Mudiyanselage Tissa Pamunuwa, 2. Konara Mudiyanselage Indrawansha Pamunuwa, 3.Konara Mudiyanselage Swarna Pamunuwa, 4. Konara Mudiyanselage Ashoka Pamunuwa, Walawela, Pamunuwa; Extent : 0.0153 Hectare",
