      481.31,
      541.85,
      608.75
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Yatawatta on 20.01.2025 at 10.00 a.m. are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 30th day of December, 2024 the nature of their interest in the Land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
